	abstract = {Standalone examples of Fortran 2018 and 2023 standard features. Popular, free-to-use Fortran compilers (GCC, Intel oneAPI, NVIDIA, Cray, IBM OpenXL, AOCC, Flang) and paid compilers such as NAG support all or many Fortran 2008 and 2018 standards.

